# Track ONLY the library: RxRx19a/src/**.py, plus README and requirements.
# Everything else -- data, checkpoints, logs, samples, scripts, archive -- is
# local. Note this governs UNtracked files only; already-committed ones stay
# tracked until `git rm --cached`.

# 1. Ignore everything by default
*

# 2. But descend into directories so nested keeps are reachable
!*/

# 3. The library
!RxRx19a/src/**/*.py
!lincs/src/**/*.py

# 4. Project files
!RxRx19a/README.md
!RxRx19a/requirements.txt
!lincs/requirements.txt
!LICENSE
!.gitignore

!lincs/*.md

# 5. Never, even under src/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
